{"updated":"2026-11-01T20:58:20.854Z","sort":"hot","note":"追蹤帳號近 72 小時貼文，依互動分數（讚 + 回覆×2 + 轉發×3）排序","groups":[{"keyword":"@malilion.dev","posts":[{"id":"DfKZ-srE6Sc","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKZ-srE6Sc","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"打造一隻自己的 AI VTuber 或虛擬桌寵，終於不用再搞到心態炸裂了。\n\n最近逛到一個專為「虛擬 AI 伴侶」打造的開源神級框架：Airi (by moeru-ai)。\n\n以前想做這種專案有多崩潰？你得自己手搓語音辨識（ASR）聽懂人話、串大模型（LLM）思考，再接語音合成（TTS）發聲，最後還要寫一堆程式碼去同步 Live2D / VRM 皮套的嘴型跟情緒動作，開了四五個 Terminal 還常常卡成木偶。\n\nAiri 直接把「聽、想、說、動」打包成完整的閉環管線。只要寫好設定檔給她人設、口癖與專屬記憶，就能一鍵喚醒一個低延遲、會隨對話情緒自動變換表情與動作的二次元數位伴侶。\n\n比起以前東拼西湊拼裝車還延遲三秒，這套優雅又絲滑太多了","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:47:20.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKZ_WbE9Yn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKZ_WbE9Yn","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/moeru…","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:47:25.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKYqPOAFqe","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKYqPOAFqe","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"AI Agent 已經進化到自己蓋辦公室了？😂\n\n最近看到一個超酷的案例：X 上的 dallastesla 召集自己的 Grok Bots 開會，問它們想在什麼樣的環境工作。\n\n結果幾個小時後，這群 AI 竟然自己打造出一間虛擬辦公室！\n\n而且不只是像素裝飾，它能即時反映 Agent 的運作狀態：\n\n🏢 收到任務 → AI 走到自己的辦公桌敲鍵盤\n\n🤝 跨模型協作 → 走到同事桌前，或去沙發休息區討論\n\n📋 需要主管審核 → 走進幕僚長 Alfred 的辦公室交接\n\n其實這些走路動畫對執行任務完全沒必要，但比起整天盯著死板乾癟的 Terminal Log，把抽象流程變成「看自己的 AI 員工上班」，體驗直接完全不同。\n\n未來管理 AI Agent，搞不好真的就像在玩《模擬市民》或經營養成遊戲。\n\n只是沒想到，連 AI 最後都逃不過回辦公室上班的命運 🤣\n\n原始影片與推文放留言👇","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:37:21.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":4,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfKY2TDk9ah","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfKY2TDk9ah","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"x.com/dalla…","timestamp":"2026-10-31T14:37:27.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJbauE6Q7","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJbauE6Q7","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"如果說 shadcn/ui 給了你乾淨好維護的骨架，那 Magic UI 就是直接幫你的 Landing Page 注入靈魂。裡面整包全都是寫好 Framer Motion + Tailwind CSS 的現成動效組件——像跑動的光束（Animated Beam）、Bento Grid、Dock 欄、霓虹邊框，全都可以直接複製貼上或用 CLI 抓進專案。\n\n特別是配合 Cursor / Claude Code 搓官網時，直接叫 AI 抓組件組裝，5 分鐘就能搞定頂級質感的 SaaS 首頁。\n\n比每次在那邊手調 CSS keyframes 幾像素、還被嫌頁面很死板快了大概 100 倍","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:24:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":4,"reposts":2,"shares":0},"score":18,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJcQEE5Do","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJcQEE5Do","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"github.com/magic…\nmalilion.github.io/githu…","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:25:06.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHJc52kzGG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfHJc52kzGG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"歡迎加入\nline.me/ti/g2…","timestamp":"2026-10-30T08:25:11.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFVksOk7LL","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVksOk7LL","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"GitHub：\ngithub.com/smith…\n線上體驗：\nlab.tongjiang.app","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:38.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfFVXA5gNzG","url":"https://www.threads.com/@malilion.dev/post/DfFVXA5gNzG","username":"malilion.dev","displayName":"malilion.dev","content":"它把高中物理、化學、生物、地理的知識，直接做成可以操作的 3D 互動實驗。\n\n目前已經有 54 個實驗，包含光電效應、電解反應、細胞分裂、洋流與大氣環流等。\n\n最酷的是，每個實驗都是一個約 1 MB 的獨立 HTML 檔案，不需要安裝軟體，下載後直接用瀏覽器開啟，離線也能操作。\n\n而且不是單純播放動畫，還能調整實驗參數，觀察 3D 模型變化，搭配步驟引導理解原理。\n\n所以拿來做互動式教學感覺超級適合\n甚至可以把抽象的技術文件變成能親手操作的互動教材。\n\n感覺以後學習複雜知識，不一定只能看影片，直接進去實驗可能更有趣 😂","timestamp":"2026-10-29T15:32:31.000Z","stats":{"likes":4,"replies":1,"reposts":2,"shares":1},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@dcard.tw","posts":[{"id":"DfM5X9nCtjn","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfM5X9nCtjn","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"天秤座的個性：\n1.不太敢拒絕別人所託之事\n2.常會觀看別人的臉色因而改變自己的態度\n3.才華洋溢，喜歡幻想\n\n歡迎補充更多天秤座特質🥸","timestamp":"2026-11-01T14:00:09.000Z","stats":{"likes":31,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":33,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfMykpsjsAa","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfMykpsjsAa","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"大家都做過什麼副業呢？👀\n一位卡友分享：最近跟身邊的朋友聊工作\n發現超過八成的朋友除了自己的主業\n還有在做至少 2 個以上的副業\n有副業好像已經成為主流了😲\n最常見的是下班跑外送\n或是假日去餐飲業打工\n\n歡迎分享你的副業🤓","timestamp":"2026-11-01T13:00:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":9,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfMyl2LjmHx","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfMyl2LjmHx","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"有人打算把副業當主業了嗎？\n原文來自✨大家都做過什麼副業？✨\n搜尋文章標題，就能看更多閒聊的討論～","timestamp":"2026-11-01T13:00:52.000Z","stats":{"likes":2,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfMrrgGiibO","url":"https://www.threads.com/@dcard.tw/post/DfMrrgGiibO","username":"dcard.tw","displayName":"dcard.tw","content":"一位卡友分享：離職最好別自己退LINE群\n最好是要讓公司把自己踢出群組\n或是請別的同事幫自己退群\n才能保住所有之前的對話紀錄\n有人說特別是有勞資糾紛的\n一定要等公司退\n不然東西都不見就沒證據了\n還有人說要把想罵的放記事本\n這樣之後的人才看得到🤣\n\n你是主動派還是被動派呢？👀","timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:00:29.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":1},"score":10,"first_seen":"2026-11-02