…","timestamp":"2026-11-01T09:37:44.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfMOgVdipZI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfMOgVdipZI","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"測試另一個 AI 服務，現在字卡、錯誤片段我都可以輕鬆剪輯修改不用重做\n下面有第一版","timestamp":"2026-11-01T07:46:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":3,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfMv0cmFLB6","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfMv0cmFLB6","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:36:39.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":0,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfMv0BBFO55","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfMv0BBFO55","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"美版紅白機也能變成復古桌機？YouTuber Throaty Mumbo 替 NES 加上鍵盤滑鼠與自製桌面介面，還展示影音播放和《毀滅戰士》。這是搭配額外硬體的玩家改造，並非原機直接升級；中間碰過哪些失敗、最後怎麼拼起來？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-01T12:36:36.000Z","stats":{"likes":0,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":2,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfMGApllKuv","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfMGApllKuv","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"kocpc.com.tw/archi…","timestamp":"2026-11-01T06:31:19.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":1,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false},{"id":"DfMF_MqFB6D","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kocpc/post/DfMF_MqFB6D","username":"kocpc","displayName":"kocpc","content":"pCloud 雙 11 開跑！3TB 雲端空間、Pass 密碼管理與 Encryption 三合一終身組合，優惠價 579 美元，活動至 11/18。單買儲存不含後兩項，加密也只適用 Crypto Folder 內檔案；各方案怎麼選？文章連結在留言處","timestamp":"2026-11-01T06:31:07.000Z","stats":{"likes":1,"replies":1,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":3,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@ai.lanrenbao","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@darrell_tw_","posts":[{"id":"DfM-u_gH15-","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfM-u_gH15-","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"上一篇 AI 已經幫忙把影片分類好\n這集放手讓 AI 剪影片！\n\n先跟 AI 討論你要的風格\n整理成規則後\n就讓他把每天的素材逐一剪完\n\n出片後我們只檢查三件事\n1. 畫面有沒有壞掉\n2. 卡片有沒有蓋到重要場景\n3. 時間和資訊顯示是否正確\n\n把你塵封在記憶卡或硬碟的旅遊影片們拿出來試試看","timestamp":"2026-11-01T14:46:59.000Z","stats":{"likes":55,"replies":3,"reposts":4,"shares":36},"score":73,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfM_nkOD5Sz","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfM_nkOD5Sz","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"這邊放一個小片段\n預計還會有下一篇來分享\n\n如何在旅途中解放雙手也能拍片！\n\n片段中的影片完全不需要手持設備\n只需要準備一台小巧的隨身相機\n再搭配適合的配件們就好","timestamp":"2026-11-01T14:57:03.000Z","stats":{"likes":7,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":2},"score":7,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfHvQpIAcNH","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfHvQpIAcNH","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"Firstrade 不要以為你用貓咪賣萌的 500 error 就可以\n看了一下又不是熔斷\n怎麼 Firstrade 自己先燒掉了\n\n用 app 進不去的人可以嘗試用網頁版，比較有機會進的去","timestamp":"2026-10-30T13:55:34.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":2,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":12,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfGuj9CkUsI","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfGuj9CkUsI","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"當初做股票的 mods \n不是為了看到這個...","timestamp":"2026-10-30T04:30:13.000Z","stats":{"likes":17,"replies":3,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":23,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfFftcBgQTN","url":"https://www.threads.com/@darrell_tw_/post/DfFftcBgQTN","username":"darrell_tw_","displayName":"darrell_tw_","content":"OpenAI pro 方案\n額度兩倍！\n\n也就是說原本20x縮水成10x的計劃取消","timestamp":"2026-10-29T17:01:12.000Z","stats":{"likes":133,"replies":29,"reposts":5,"shares":28},"score":206,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":false}]},{"keyword":"@c.yu.an_","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@kelly_guooo","posts":[{"id":"DfKzM4tD61s","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfKzM4tD61s","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"收到Claude五小時限制取消的信件了！","timestamp":"2026-10-31T18:27:43.000Z","stats":{"likes":18,"replies":0,"reposts":0,"shares":0},"score":18,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true},{"id":"DfIzboNj3F4","url":"https://www.threads.com/@kelly_guooo/post/DfIzboNj3F4","username":"kelly_guooo","displayName":"kelly_guooo","content":"Claude 把 5 小時限制拿掉了，但只有一部分人有。\n​\nAnthropic 官方公告，方案改名：Max 5x 改叫 Max，Max 20x 改叫 Ultra，價格不變，每月 US$100 和 US$200。\n​\nUltra 這次拿掉了 5 小時限制，只限通過驗證的帳號，分批開放。官方的理由是：Claude 越來越多工作會在背景跑好幾個小時，不該做到一半就因為 5 小時限制停下來。\n​\n這篇整理了：\n◼︎ 新舊方案名稱對照\n◼︎ 怎麼檢查自己有沒有通過驗證\n◼︎ 20x 變 10x，到底有沒有被砍\n◼︎ $100 和 $200 現在該怎麼選\n​","timestamp":"2026-10-30T23:51:15.000Z","stats":{"likes":8,"replies":0,"reposts":1,"shares":1},"score":11,"first_seen":"2026-11-02T00:40:40+08:00","latest":true}]},{"keyword":"@lazyoffice2024","posts":[]},{"keyword":"@ironv.careerlife","posts":[]}]}